         "elType": "widget"
        },
        {
         "id": "5204145a",
         "settings": {
          "title": "Breathe Cleaner, Healthier Air with Complete IAQ Solutions",
          "header_size": "h2",
          "typography_font_size": {
           "unit": "custom",
           "size": "var(--text-2xl)",
           "sizes": []
          },
          "typography_font_size_tablet": {
           "unit": "custom",
           "size": "var(--text-2xl)",
           "sizes": []
          },
          "typography_font_size_mobile": {
           "unit": "custom",
           "size": "var(--text-2xl)",
           "sizes": []
          },
          "typography_typography": "custom",
          "_css_classes": "section__title"
         },
         "elements": [],
         "isInner": true,
         "widgetType": "heading",
         "elType": "widget"
        },
        {
         "id": "520427b1",
         "settings": {
          "editor": "Truly clean indoor air takes more than just a standard air filter. We focus on four core air quality solutions to clean, balance, and optimize the air your family breathes:",
          "_css_classes": "section__lead"
         },
         "elements": [],
         "isInner": true,
         "widgetType": "text-editor",
         "elType": "widget"
        }
       ],
       "isInner": true,
       "elType": "container"
      },
      {
       "id": "52044e5f",
       "settings": {
        "content_width": "full",
        "css_classes": "hub-list hub-list--grid"
       },
       "elements": [
        {
         "id": "52027e37",
         "settings": {
          "content_width": "full",
          "html_tag": "article",
          "css_classes": "hub-svc"
         },
         "elements": [
          {
           "id": "520230db",
           "settings": {
            "html": "<span class=\"symptom__icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-air\"/></svg></span>"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "html",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "52024432",
           "settings": {
            "title": "1. <span class=\"lz-nw\">Whole-Home</span> Air Purification &amp; Filtration",
            "header_size": "h3"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "heading",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "52025789",
           "settings": {
            "editor": "<p>Standard HVAC air filters only trap large dust clumps—they let tiny allergens, dust mites, pet dander, and airborne debris blow right through into your rooms. Whole-home air purifiers and media air cleaners are installed directly into your central HVAC ductwork. Working continuously, they capture microscopic particulates and scrub the air circulating through every room in your house before you breathe it in.</p>",
            "_css_classes": "hub-svc__body"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "text-editor",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "52026ae0",
           "settings": {
            "html": "<a class=\"svc-band__go hub-svc__go\" href=\"/air-purification/\">Explore Whole-Home Air Purification <svg class=\"icon-sm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-arrow\"/></svg></a>"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "html",
           "elType": "widget"
          }
         ],
         "isInner": true,
         "elType": "container"
        },
        {
         "id": "5202deea",
         "settings": {
          "content_width": "full",
          "html_tag": "article",
          "css_classes": "hub-svc"
         },
         "elements": [
          {
           "id": "5202918e",
           "settings": {
            "html": "<span class=\"symptom__icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-shield\"/></svg></span>"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "html",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "5202a4e5",
           "settings": {
            "title": "2. Germicidal UV Light Air Purification",
            "header_size": "h3"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "heading",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "5202b83c",
           "settings": {
            "editor": "<p>Standard air filters cannot kill microscopic germs. Installed directly near your AC coil and main ductwork, germicidal UV lights (like the <b>Patriot UV Air Purifier</b>) use powerful UV-C light technology to sanitize the air inside your system. They actively destroy airborne viruses, bacteria, mold spores, and harsh chemical odors, preventing growth on your cooling coils and keeping your system clean.</p>",
            "_css_classes": "hub-svc__body"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "text-editor",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "5202cb93",
           "settings": {
            "html": "<a class=\"svc-band__go hub-svc__go\" href=\"/uv-light-purification/\">Explore UV Light Purification Systems <svg class=\"icon-sm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-arrow\"/></svg></a>"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "html",
           "elType": "widget"
          }
         ],
         "isInner": true,
         "elType": "container"
        },
        {
         "id": "520352f4",
         "settings": {
          "content_width": "full",
          "html_tag": "article",
          "css_classes": "hub-svc"
         },
         "elements": [
          {
           "id": "5202f241",
           "settings": {
            "html": "<span class=\"symptom__icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-droplet\"/></svg></span>"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "html",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "52030598",
           "settings": {
            "title": "3. <span class=\"lz-nw\">Whole-Home</span> Humidity Control: Humidifiers &amp; Dehumidifiers",
            "header_size": "h3"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "heading",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "520318ef",
           "settings": {
            "editor": "<p>Central Iowa winters are bone-dry, while summers bring sticky, muggy heat. Imbalanced indoor humidity ruins your home's air and damages your property.</p><p>Installed seamlessly onto your furnace, our whole-home bypass and power steam humidifiers maintain ideal 30–50% indoor humidity levels automatically year-round.</p>",
            "_css_classes": "hub-svc__body"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "text-editor",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "52033f9d",
           "settings": {
            "html": "<ul class=\"checklist\"><li><svg class=\"icon-sm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg><span><b>Summer Dehumidifiers:</b> Pull excess moisture out of your air to prevent basement mold growth, clammy living spaces, and musty smells.</span></li><li><svg class=\"icon-sm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg><span><b>Winter Humidifiers:</b> Inject clean moisture into dry winter air to eliminate static shocks, dry skin, bloody noses, and cracking hardwood floors.</span></li></ul>"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "html",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "52032c46",
           "settings": {
            "html": "<a class=\"svc-band__go hub-svc__go\" href=\"/humidity-control/\">Explore Whole-Home Humidity Control <svg class=\"icon-sm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-arrow\"/></svg></a>"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "html",
           "elType": "widget"
          }
         ],
         "isInner": true,
         "elType": "container"
        },
        {
         "id": "5203a050",
         "settings": {
          "content_width": "full",
          "html_tag": "article",
          "css_classes": "hub-svc"
         },
         "elements": [
          {
           "id": "5203664b",
           "settings": {
            "html": "<span class=\"symptom__icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-wind\"/></svg></span>"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "html",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "520379a2",
           "settings": {
            "title": "4. Professional Air Duct Cleaning &amp; Vent Sanitation",
            "header_size": "h3"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "heading",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "52038cf9",
           "settings": {
            "editor": "<p>Your air ducts act as the \"lungs\" of your home. Over time, supply and return vents build up thick layers of dust, pollen, pet hair, dead skin cells, and construction debris. Every time your heater or AC turns on, those allergens blow directly into your living room and bedrooms. Our certified technicians use high-powered rotary brushes and negative-pressure vacuum trucks to scrub your duct walls clean, finishing with a hospital-grade antimicrobial spray to sanitize against mold spores and bacteria.</p>",
            "_css_classes": "hub-svc__body"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "text-editor",
           "elType": "widget"
          }
         ],
         "isInner": true,
         "elType": "container"
        },
        {
         "id": "5203edac",
         "settings": {
          "content_width": "full",
          "html_tag": "article",
          "css_classes": "hub-svc"
         },
         "elements": [
          {
           "id": "5203b3a7",
           "settings": {
            "html": "<span class=\"symptom__icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-wrench\"/></svg></span>"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "html",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "5203c6fe",
           "settings": {
            "title": "5. Ductwork Repair, Sealing &amp; Replacement",
            "header_size": "h3"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "heading",
           "elType": "widget"
          },
          {
           "id": "5203da55",
           "settings": {
            "editor": "<p>You can buy the most expensive furnace or AC unit on the market, but if your ductwork is cracked, crushed, or disconnected, you're wasting money. Leaky air ducts can allow up to 30% of your heated or cooled air to escape behind walls, while pulling dirty, dusty air directly out of attics or crawlspaces. We inspect, seal, repair, and replace home ductwork to eliminate uneven hot/cold spots, boost airflow, and lower your monthly energy bills.</p>",
            "_css_classes": "hub-svc__body"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "text-editor",
           "elType": "widget"
          }
         ],
         "isInner": true,
         "elType": "container"
        }
       ],
       "isInner": true,
       "elType": "container"
      }
     ],
     "isInner": true,
     "elType": "container"
